      },
      "date": "2026-10-20 03:35:03.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\nThis patch depends on https://review.whamcloud.com/69506 (LU-20896 llite: transfer ciphertext for O_CIPHERTEXT DIO), which makes O_CIPHERTEXT direct IO return the ciphertext when the encryption key is loaded. Without 69506 the PCC copy of an encrypted file would hold plaintext (sanity-pcc test_50d fails). Test-Parameters: ignore until 69506 lands; it then needs a rebase onto it with normal testing. Tested locally on 69505+69506: sanity-pcc 21i 21j 40 50a-50d 103 104 pass.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 1
    },
