      "date": "2026-11-06 19:04:16.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 7:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nMostly good, minor comments inline; none of them needs a re-spin by itself, though the O_SYNC question is worth an answer.\n\ntest_50d only exercises a single thread and a single read: pcc_copy_data_dio() shrinks iosize to the rounded file size, so the helper computes zero threads and uses one. Consider also setting pcc_dio_attach_iosize_mb=1 with an encrypted file of 8 MiB or more that is not unit aligned, so that the multi-threaded chunks and the tail read are covered.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 7
    }
